%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-objects-functions-keyset (関数ページ)
doc と相違 (doc の Output と実 DW の出力の値が一致しない)
doc の Output:
  {
    "keySet": [
      "http://test.com",
      "http://test.com",
      {
        "name": "Mariano",
        "lastName": "Achaval"
      },
      {
        "name": "Stacey",
        "lastName": "Duke"
      }
    ],
    "nameSet": [
      null,
      null,
      null,
      null
    ]
  }
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import * from dw::core::Objects
var myVar = read('<users xmlns="http://test.com">
                     <user name="Mariano" lastName="Achaval"/>
                     <user name="Stacey" lastName="Duke"/>
                  </users>', 'application/xml')
output application/json
---
{ keySetExample: flatten([keySet(myVar.users) map $.#,
                          keySet(myVar.users) map $.@])
}
++
{ nameSet: flatten([nameSet(myVar.users) map $.#,
                    nameSet(myVar.users) map $.@])
}
%%% output application/json
{
  "keySetExample": [
    "http://test.com",
    "http://test.com",
    {
      "name": "Mariano",
      "lastName": "Achaval"
    },
    {
      "name": "Stacey",
      "lastName": "Duke"
    }
  ],
  "nameSet": [
    null,
    null,
    null,
    null
  ]
}
